Subject: [PATCH v1 0/5] power: supply: add Silicon Mitus SM5714 fuel gauge and charger
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Add bindings and drivers for the fuel-gauge and switching-charger blocks
of the Silicon Mitus SM5714 PMIC used on the Samsung Galaxy A52 4G
(a52q, SM7125). The Type-C CC and MUIC blocks of the same chip are sent
as a separate series to the USB/typec tree.

The fuel gauge reports voltage, current, temperature and state of charge;
it also reads charge_full_design from an optional monitored-battery node
and derives charge_now/charge_full so UPower can present energy. The
charger advertises its USB port type (UNKNOWN/SDP) from the VBUS-OK bit
so UPower recognises it as a line-power charger.

Based on v7.3-rc5. Not independently tested on hardware by the
submitter tooling; on-device verification pending.

Miroslav Mráz (5):
  dt-bindings: power: supply: add Silicon Mitus SM5714 fuel gauge
